#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>を所持していないため、報酬が取得できませんでした。
#. de: Da du <noun-de Item 4 $n1 1 4 1> besitzt, kannst du die Belohnung nicht erhalten.
#. fr: Impossible de recevoir la récompense. Vous ne possédez pas <noun-fr Item 8 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9001:0:5"
msgid "Unable to receive reward. You do not carry <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Невозможно получить награду. У вас нет <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: 財宝を発見した！！
#. de: Du hast eine Schatztruhe entdeckt!
#. fr: Vous avez découvert un trésor<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9002:0:5"
msgid "You discover a treasure coffer!"
msgstr "Вы нашли сокровище!"

#. ja: 財宝の気配を、<switch $n1><case>北<case>北東<case>東<case>南東<case>南<case>南西<case>西<case>北西<case>北</switch>方向のとても近くから感じているようだ！
#. de: Du spürst eine Schatztruhe sehr nah <switch $n1><case>nördlich<case>nordöstlich<case>östlich<case>südöstlich<case>südlich<case>südwestlich<case>westlich<case>nordwestlich<case>nördlich</switch> von dir!
#. fr: Le trésor est tout près d'ici, <switch $n1><case>au nord<case>au nord-est<case>à l'est<case>au sud-est<case>au sud<case>au sud-ouest<case>à l'ouest<case>au nord-ouest<case>au nord</switch><nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9003:0:5"
msgid "You sense something immediately to the <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch>."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что совсем рядом, к <switch $n1><case>северу<case>северо-востоку<case>востоку<case>юго-востоку<case>югу<case>юго-западу<case>западу<case>северо-западу<case>северу</switch>, что-то есть."

#. ja: 財宝の気配を、<switch $n1><case>北<case>北東<case>東<case>南東<case>南<case>南西<case>西<case>北西<case>北</switch>方向の近くから感じているようだ。
#. de: Du spürst eine Schatztruhe <switch $n1><case>nördlich<case>nordöstlich<case>östlich<case>südöstlich<case>südlich<case>südwestlich<case>westlich<case>nordwestlich<case>nördlich</switch> von dir!
#. fr: Le trésor est non loin d'ici, <switch $n1><case>au nord<case>au nord-est<case>à l'est<case>au sud-est<case>au sud<case>au sud-ouest<case>à l'ouest<case>au nord-ouest<case>au nord</switch><nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9004:0:5"
msgid "You sense something to the <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch>."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что неподалёку, к <switch $n1><case>северу<case>северо-востоку<case>востоку<case>юго-востоку<case>югу<case>юго-западу<case>западу<case>северо-западу<case>северу</switch>, что-то есть."

#. ja: 財宝の気配を、<switch $n1><case>北<case>北東<case>東<case>南東<case>南<case>南西<case>西<case>北西<case>北</switch>方向の遠くから感じているようだ……
#. de: Du spürst eine Schatztruhe weit <switch $n1><case>nördlich<case>nordöstlich<case>östlich<case>südöstlich<case>südlich<case>südwestlich<case>westlich<case>nordwestlich<case>nördlich</switch> von dir!
#. fr: Le trésor est assez loin d'ici, <switch $n1><case>au nord<case>au nord-est<case>à l'est<case>au sud-est<case>au sud<case>au sud-ouest<case>à l'ouest<case>au nord-ouest<case>au nord</switch><nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9005:0:5"
msgid "You sense something far to the <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch>."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что далеко к <switch $n1><case>северу<case>северо-востоку<case>востоку<case>юго-востоку<case>югу<case>юго-западу<case>западу<case>северо-западу<case>северу</switch> что-то есть..."

#. ja: 財宝の気配を、<switch $n1><case>北<case>北東<case>東<case>南東<case>南<case>南西<case>西<case>北西<case>北</switch>方向のとても遠くから感じているようだ
#. de: Du spürst eine Schatztruhe sehr weit <switch $n1><case>nördlich<case>nordöstlich<case>östlich<case>südöstlich<case>südlich<case>südwestlich<case>westlich<case>nordwestlich<case>nördlich</switch> von dir!
#. fr: Le trésor est très loin d'ici, <switch $n1><case>au nord<case>au nord-est<case>à l'est<case>au sud-est<case>au sud<case>au sud-ouest<case>à l'ouest<case>au nord-ouest<case>au nord</switch><nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9006:0:5"
msgid "You sense something far, far to the <switch $n1><case>north<case>northeast<case>east<case>southeast<case>south<case>southwest<case>west<case>northwest<case>north</switch>."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что очень далеко к <switch $n1><case>северу<case>северо-востоку<case>востоку<case>юго-востоку<case>югу<case>юго-западу<case>западу<case>северо-западу<case>северу</switch> что-то есть."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>が懐いたようだ。<br>イベントアイテム「<sheet EventItem $n2 0>」を使用して<br>財宝の気配を探らせよう！
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> haben dich in ihr Herz geschlossen.<br>Benutze den Schlüsselgegenstand <noun-de EventItem 5 $n2 1 4 1>, um ihre Schatztruhe aufzuspüren.
#. fr: Le <noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n1 1 1> vous a <if $gn4>prise<else>pris</if> en amitié<nbsp>! Utilisez <noun-fr Item 2 $n2 1 1> pour qu'il vous guide jusqu'à son trésor<nbsp>!
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9007:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> no longer seems frightened. Use your <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 1 1> to have him lead you to buried treasure."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> больше не боится. Используйте <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 1 1>, чтобы он привёл вас к зарытому сокровищу."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>を見失ってしまった……
#. de: Du hast <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 4 1> aus den Augen verloren.
#. fr: Vous avez perdu de vue <noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1>...
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9008:0:5"
msgid "You have lost sight of <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Вы потеряли из виду <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>は力尽きてしまった……
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 3 1></capitalize> ist die Puste ausgegangen.
#. fr: Le <noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n1 1 1> est à bout de forces...
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9009:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> is too injured to continue."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> слишком изранен и не может продолжать."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>を消費し、最高評価を獲得した。
#. de: Der Besitz <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 2 1> verschafft dir die höchstmögliche Wertung!
#. fr: Vous avez utilisé <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> et obtenu la meilleure évaluation possible.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9010:0:5"
msgid "You are duly rewarded for possession of <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Наличие <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> принесло вам награду."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>は、満足気に去っていった！
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> hoppelt sichtlich zufrieden davon!
#. fr: Le <noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n1 1 1> est reparti d'un bond allègre<nbsp>!
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9011:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> hops away satisfied."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> довольно упрыгал прочь."

#. ja: 一定時間が経過したため、発見した財宝を見失いました。
#. de: Du warst zu langsam! Die Schatztruhe ist wieder verschwunden.
#. fr: Le coffre s'est mys<shy>té<shy>rieu<shy>se<shy>ment volatilisé.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9012:0:5"
msgid "The coffer has mysteriously vanished."
msgstr "Сундук таинственным образом исчез."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>が微かに輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet kaum merklich.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur très faible.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9020:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with a feeble light."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок слабо светится."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>が淡く輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet schwach.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur faible.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9021:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with a gentle light."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок мерцает мягким светом."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>が輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet merklich.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur assez vive.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9022:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with a bright light."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок ярко светится."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>が強く輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet stark.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur vive.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9023:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with a brilliant light."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок сияет ослепительным светом."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>がとても強く輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet sehr stark.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur très vive.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9024:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with a blinding light."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок сияет нестерпимо ярко."

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>が眩く輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet extrem stark.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur éblouissante.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9025:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with the light of a newborn star!"
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок сияет, словно новорождённая звезда!"

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8>がとても眩く輝いた】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel leuchtet grell.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka émet une lueur plus qu'éblouissante.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9026:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle is suffused with the light of an exploding star!"
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок сияет, словно взрывающаяся звезда!"

#. ja: 【<sheet EurekaAetherItem $n1 8> には、これ以上、混合エーテルを蓄積できないようだ】
#. de: Der Ätherkessel kann kein weiteres Äthergemisch mehr aufnehmen.
#. fr: La bouilloire Eurêka ne peut pas contenir plus d'éther composite.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9027:0:5"
msgid "Your Eurekan kettle cannot accumulate any more vitiated aether."
msgstr "Ваш эвриканский котелок больше не может накапливать искажённый эфир."

#. ja: 他のデータセンターのメンバーがいるため、PvPチーム結成の申請は行えません。
#. de: PvP-Team kann nicht gebildet werden, weil ein oder mehrere Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder aus einem anderen Datenzentrum stammen.
#. fr: Action impossible. Un ou plusieurs équipiers viennent d'un autre centre de traitement de données.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9030:0:5"
msgid "Unable to create PvP team. One or more party members are from another data center."
msgstr "Невозможно создать PvP-команду: в группе есть участники с других дата-центров."

#. ja: ホームワールドと異なるデータセンターにいるため、PvPチーム結成に同意できませんでした。
#. de: Du kannst der Bildung eines PvP-Teams nicht zustimmen, solange du dich außerhalb des eigenen Datenzentrums befindest.
#. fr: Action impossible. Vous ne vous trouvez pas dans votre centre de traitement de données d'origine.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9031:0:5"
msgid "Unable to confirm PvP team creation while outside your Home Data Center."
msgstr "Невозможно подтвердить создание PvP-команды вне домашнего дата-центра."

#. ja: <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0>のホットバー／クロスホットバーを引き継ぎました。<br>修得済みのジョブアクションを確認の上、ホットバー／クロスホットバーの見直しをおすすめします。
#. de: Die Kommandomenü- und Kreuzkommandomenü-Einstellungen von <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0> wurden übertragen.<br>Passe sie nun nach Bedarf an.
#. fr: Les paramètres des barres et croix de raccourcis de la classe <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0> ont été transférés.<br>Veillez à bien consulter les actions de job nouvellement obtenues pour ajuster vos barres/croix en conséquence.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = text with macros, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 29> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 29 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9035:0:5"
msgid "Hotbar and cross hotbar settings for <sheet ClassJob \"<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>\" 0> have been successfully transferred. It is recommended<br>that you confirm any previously learned job actions and adjust your hotbars and cross hotbars accordingly."
msgstr "Настройки панелей команд и кросс-панелей для профессии «<sheet ClassJob \"<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>\" 0>» перенесены.<br>Проверьте изученные действия и настройте панели команд и кросс-панели."

#. ja: ホットバー／クロスホットバーの引き継ぎを保留しました。<br>次回<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>になった際、再度引き継ぎの確認が開きます。
#. de: Die Kommandomenü- und Kreuzkommandomenü-Einstellungen wurden nicht übertragen.<br>Beim nächsten Jobwechsel auf <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> wirst du noch einmal gefragt.
#. fr: Les paramètres des barres et croix de raccourcis ont été enregistrés.<br>Vous pourrez effectuer le transfert la prochaine fois que vous choisirez le job <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9036:0:5"
msgid "Transfer of hotbar and cross hotbar settings has been postponed.<br>You will be prompted to transfer settings again when changing jobs to <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>."
msgstr "Перенос настроек панелей команд и кросс-панелей отложен.<br>Вас снова спросят о переносе, когда вы смените профессию на <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0><if ($n2 > 0)>と<sheet Item $n2 0></if>の交換には、クエスト『<sheet Quest $n3 0>』<if ($n4 > 0)>かクエスト『<sheet Quest $n4 0>』</if>をコンプリートする必要があります。
#. de: Um <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1><if ($n2 > 0)> und <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1></if> eintauschen zu können, muss der Auftrag „<sheet Quest $n3 0>“<if ($n4 > 0)> und der Auftrag „<sheet Quest $n4 0>“</if> abgeschlossen worden sein.
#. fr: Une fois la quête “<sheet Quest $n3 0>”<if ($n4 > 0)> ou “<sheet Quest $n4 0>”</if> accomplie, vous pourrez échanger <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1><if ($n2 > 0)> et <noun-fr Item 1 $n2 1 1></if>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 > 0)> and <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet Quest $n3 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Quest, row = number parameter 3, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n4 > 0)> or <sheet Quest $n4 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 4 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet Quest $n4 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Quest, row = number parameter 4, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9041:0:5"
msgid "To exchange <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1><if ($n2 > 0)> and <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if>, you must first complete the quest <sheet Quest $n3 0><if ($n4 > 0)> or <sheet Quest $n4 0></if>."
msgstr "Чтобы обменять <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1><if ($n2 > 0)> и <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if>, сначала завершите задание «<sheet Quest $n3 0>»<if ($n4 > 0)> или «<sheet Quest $n4 0>»</if>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0><if ($n2 > 0)>と<sheet Item $n2 0></if>の交換には、『<sheet InstanceContent $n3 3>』を攻略する必要があります。
#. de: Um <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1><if ($n2 > 0)> und <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1></if> eintauschen zu können, muss der Inhalt „<sheet InstanceContent $n3 3>“ abgeschlossen worden sein.
#. fr: Une fois la mission “<sheet InstanceContent $n3 3>” accomplie, vous pourrez échanger <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1><if ($n2 > 0)> et <noun-fr Item 1 $n2 1 1></if>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 > 0)> and <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
