#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9932:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtain<else>obtains</if> <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1><else><kilo $n1 \",\"> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>получаете<else>получает</if> <if ($n1 == 1)>предмет: <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1><else><kilo $n1 \",\"> шт.: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1></if>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n1 0><if ($n2 > 1)>×<num $n2></if>を手に入れた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> <if ($n2 > 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1><else><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></if> erhalten.
#. fr: Vous obtenez <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtain<else>obtains</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9933:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtain<else>obtains</if> <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>получаете<else>получает</if> <if ($n2 == 1)>предмет: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> шт.: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は所持数の上限に達しているため持ちきれませんでした。
#. de: Du kannst <noun-de Item 4 $n1 2 4 1> mehr erhalten. Die Obergrenze ist erreicht.
#. fr: Impossible de récupérer l'objet suivant<nbsp>: <sheet Item $n1 0>. Capacité maximale atteinte.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9934:0:5"
msgid "You cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "У вас больше нет места для <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨が不足しているため、実行できません。
#. de: Kann nicht ausgeführt werden, weil du nicht ausreichend blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris hast.
#. fr: Assignats insulaires azur insuffisants.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9935:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute command. Insufficient seafarer's cowries."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить команду. Недостаточно синих раковин мореплавателя."

#. ja: 新たに探索隊が帰還し、受取可能な開拓素材が追加されました。<br>開拓素材を受け取り後、再度実行してください。
#. de: Diese Expedition hat bereits Funde zurückgebracht. Nimm sie entgegen und versuche es erneut.
#. fr: La troupe d'expédition est de retour<nbsp>; de nouveaux matériaux peuvent être récupérés.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9936:0:5"
msgid "You may now collect new materials from foraging expeditions. Dispatch another expedition after collecting their findings."
msgstr "Можно забрать новые материалы из экспедиции по сбору ресурсов. После этого отправьте в путь следующую экспедицию.<br>"

#. ja: 新たに探索隊が帰還し、受取可能な開拓素材が追加されました。<br>再度受け取りを実行してください。
#. de: Diese Expedition hat bereits Funde zurückgebracht. Nimm sie entgegen.
#. fr: La troupe d'expédition est de retour<nbsp>; de nouveaux matériaux peuvent être récupérés.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9937:0:5"
msgid "You may now collect new materials from foraging expeditions. Collect the materials gathered from the latest expedition."
msgstr "Можно забрать новые материалы из экспедиции по сбору ресурсов. Заберите добычу последней экспедиции.<br>"

#. ja: 受け取り可能な開拓素材が存在しません。
#. de: Kein Material gefunden.
#. fr: Aucun matériau à récupérer.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9938:0:5"
msgid "There are no materials to collect."
msgstr "Нет материалов для сбора."

#. ja: 受け取り可能な開拓素材が、全て所持数の上限に達しているため受け取りができません。
#. de: Du kannst keinen der Funde erhalten. Die Obergrenze für alle gefundenen Gegenstände ist erreicht.
#. fr: Impossible de récupérer les matériaux. Capacité maximale atteinte.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9939:0:5"
msgid "You cannot carry any more of the materials gathered from this expedition."
msgstr "У вас больше нет места для материалов, собранных в этой экспедиции."

#. ja: シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨<num $n1>枚を渡し、「<string $s2>」に探索依頼しました。
#. de: Du hast <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauri<else>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris</if> ausgegeben, um eine Expedition in das Gebiet „<string $s2>“ auszuschicken.
#. fr: <string $s2><nbsp>: troupe d'expédition envoyée contre <num $n1> assignats insulaires azur.
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9940:0:5"
msgid "You spent <kilo $n1 \",\"> seafarer's cowries to send an expedition to the <string $s2>."
msgstr "Вы потратили <kilo $n1 \",\"> синих раковин мореплавателя, чтобы отправить экспедицию в область «<string $s2>»."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は所持数の上限に達しているため、製作ができません。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> können nicht hergestellt werden. Die Obergrenze ist erreicht.
#. fr: Impossible de fabriquer l'objet suivant<nbsp>: <sheet Item $n1 0>. Capacité maximale atteinte.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9941:0:5"
msgid "Unable to craft item. <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Нельзя изготовить предмет: у <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вас<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> больше нет места для <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 受け取っていない開拓素材が存在するため、探索地や探索日数の変更ができません。
#. de: Die Dauer der Expedition kann nicht verlängert werden, weil es für sie noch nicht abgeholte Funde gibt.
#. fr: Impossible de modifier le lieu et la durée<nbsp>: certains matériaux n'ont pas été récupérés.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9942:0:5"
msgid "Unable to change parameters of expedition. You have yet to claim the gathered materials."
msgstr "Невозможно изменить параметры экспедиции. Сначала заберите собранные материалы."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>がグラナリーオフィスで入手可能になりました。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> können nun während der Expeditionen der Kornkammer gefunden werden.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> peut désormais s'obtenir à la grange.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9943:0:5"
msgid "You may now obtain <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> from foraging expeditions."
msgstr "Теперь <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> можно получить в экспедициях по сбору ресурсов."

#. ja: 必要な材料が足りなかったため、開拓工房での生産ができなかった島産品があります。
#. de: Im Inselatelier konnten einige Inselgüter nicht hergestellt werden, weil die notwenigen Materialien fehlen.
#. fr: Certains biens n'ont pas pu être produits comme prévu<nbsp>: les matériaux étaient insuffisants.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9944:0:5"
msgid "There were insufficient materials to finish production of all scheduled handicrafts."
msgstr "Не хватило материалов, чтобы завершить изготовление всех запланированных товаров."

#. ja: 開拓工房の空き時間が不足していたため、スケジュールを設定できませんでした。
#. de: Der Plan konnte nicht erstellt werden, da nicht ausreichend Arbeitsstunden verfügbar sind.
#. fr: Planification impossible<nbsp>: durée nécessaire avant le prochain cycle insuffisante.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9945:0:5"
msgid "Unable to set agenda. Insufficient time to produce selected handicraft."
msgstr "Не удалось составить расписание. Не хватит времени, чтобы изготовить выбранный товар."

#. ja: 開拓工房のおやすみ予定を変更しました。
#. de: Du hast die Ruhetage des Inselateliers geändert.
#. fr: Les cycles de repos ont été modifiés.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9946:0:5"
msgid "You change the workshop's rest cycle schedule."
msgstr "Вы изменили расписание выходных в мастерской."

#. ja: 開拓拠点を拡張するための資材を製作した！
#. de: Du hast das nötige Werkzeug hergestellt, um dein Domizil zu vergrößern!
#. fr: Vous avez fabriqué le nécessaire pour agrandir la base d'opérations<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9947:0:5"
msgid "The hideaway may now be expanded with the tools you crafted!"
msgstr "Теперь можно расширить убежище с помощью изготовленных инструментов!"

#. ja: アイランドホールが建築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst nun die Strandhütte bauen!
#. fr: La hutte placide peut désormais être construite<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9948:0:5"
msgid "You may now construct the cozy cabin."
msgstr "Теперь можно построить уютный домик."

#. ja: 新たなランドマークが建築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst nun ein neues Wahrzeichen bauen!
#. fr: Un nouvel édifice peut désormais être construit<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9949:0:5"
msgid "You may now construct new landmarks."
msgstr "Теперь можно построить новые достопримечательности."

#. ja: 選択可能なアイテムを所持していません。
#. de: Du besitzt keine der auswählbaren Gegenstände.
#. fr: Vous ne possédez aucun objet à sélectionner.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9950:0:5"
msgid "You do not possess any eligible items for this action."
msgstr "У вас нет подходящих предметов для этого действия."

#. ja: 栽培委託を依頼中の畝のため、アクセスできません。
#. de: Kann nicht beackert werden, da für dieses Beet ein Saatplan vorliegt.
#. fr: Action impossible<nbsp>: un cultivateur s'occupe de cette parcelle.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9951:0:5"
msgid "Unable to access plot because it is under the produce producer's care."
msgstr "Невозможно обработать грядку: за ней ухаживает земледелец."

#. ja: 栽培委託で収穫した作物が回収されていないため、アクセスできません。<br>たがやすくんに話しかけ、受け取ってください。
#. de: Kann nicht umgepflügt werden, da der Ertrag durch den Saatplan noch nicht abgeholt wurde. Sprich erst mit Feldolin.
#. fr: Action impossible<nbsp>: vous n'avez pas récupéré les récoltes de la culture automatique.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9952:0:5"
msgid "Unable to perform action. You must collect the yield from the produce producer first."
msgstr "Сначала заберите урожай у земледельца.<br>"

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は所持数の上限に達しているため、収穫できませんでした。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> konnten nicht geerntet werden, da du die Obergrenze erreicht hast.
#. fr: Impossible de collecter l'objet suivant<nbsp>: <sheet Item $n1 0>. Capacité maximale atteinte.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9953:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute action. You cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить действие. У вас больше нет места для <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 畝<num $n1>を、<sheet Item $n2 0>で栽培委託の依頼をしました。
#. de: Du überlässt Feldolin <noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 4 1> für den Anbau auf Beet #<num $n1>.
#. fr: Parcelle <num $n1><nbsp>: les <sheet Item $n2 2> ont été confiés à un cultivateur.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9954:0:5"
msgid "You entrust the produce producer with <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> to grow in plot <num $n1>."
msgstr "Вы поручили земледельцу вырастить <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> на грядке <num $n1>."

#. ja: 栽培委託で収穫した作物が回収されていないため、栽培委託を終了できません。
#. de: Der Saatplan konnte nicht verworfen werden, da dieses Beet noch nicht abgeerntet wurde.
#. fr: Impossible de terminer la culture automatique<nbsp>: la récolte n'a pas été effectuée.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9956:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute command. You must collect the yield first."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить команду. Сначала заберите урожай."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は所持数の上限に達しているため、回収できませんでした。
#. de: Du konntest keine <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> erhalten, da du die Obergrenze erreicht hast.
#. fr: Impossible de récupérer l'objet suivant<nbsp>: <sheet Item $n1 0>. Capacité maximale atteinte.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9957:0:5"
msgid "Unable to collect yield. You cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Не удалось забрать урожай. У вас больше нет места для <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 開拓工房が建築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst nun das Inselatelier bauen!
#. fr: La fabrique peut désormais être construite<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9958:0:5"
msgid "You may now construct a workshop."
msgstr "Теперь можно построить мастерскую."

#. ja: グラナリーオフィスが建築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst nun die Kornkammer bauen!
#. fr: La grange peut désormais être construite<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9959:0:5"
msgid "You may now construct a granary."
msgstr "Теперь можно построить амбар."

#. ja: アイランドホールを改築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst deine Strandhütte umbauen!
#. fr: La hutte placide peut désormais être rénovée<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9960:0:5"
msgid "You may now renovate the cozy cabin."
msgstr "Теперь можно обновить уютный домик."

#. ja: 開拓工房が改築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst dein Inselatelier umbauen!
#. fr: La fabrique peut désormais être rénovée<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9961:0:5"
msgid "You may now renovate workshops."
msgstr "Теперь можно обновить мастерские."

#. ja: グラナリーオフィスが改築可能になりました！
#. de: Du kannst deine Kornkammer umbauen!
#. fr: La grange peut désormais être rénovée<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:9962:0:5"
msgid "You may now renovate granaries."
msgstr "Теперь можно обновить амбары."

#. ja: 拠点の開拓が完了しました。
#. de: Dein Domizil wurde erweitert.
#. fr: La base d'opérations a été agrandie.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9963:0:5"
msgid "You have completed development of your hideaway."
msgstr "Вы завершили развитие убежища."

#. ja: 拠点の景観を<sheet MJIText $n1 0>から<sheet MJIText $n2 0>に変更しました。
#. de: Du hast das Aussehen deines Domizils von „<sheet MJIText $n1 0>“ zu „<sheet MJIText $n2 0>“ geändert.
#. fr: Le paysage a été modifié en<nbsp>: <sheet MJIText $n2 0>
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9964:0:5"
msgid "You changed the terrain of your hideaway from <sheet MJIText $n1 0> to <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."
msgstr "Вы изменили ландшафт убежища: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> заменён на <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>の建築を開始しました。
#. de: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> wird nun gebaut.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: début de la con<shy>struc<shy>tion.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9965:0:5"
msgid "Construction of <sheet MJIText $n1 0> has begun."
msgstr "Началось строительство: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>の建築が完了しました。
#. de: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> wurde fertiggestellt.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: con<shy>struc<shy>tion terminée.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9966:0:5"
msgid "Construction of <sheet MJIText $n1 0> has finished."
msgstr "Строительство завершено: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>への改築を開始しました。
#. de: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> wird nun umgebaut.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: début des rénovations.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9967:0:5"
msgid "Began renovations towards <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."
msgstr "Началось обновление: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>への改築が完了しました。
#. de: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> wurde erfolgreich umgebaut.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: rénovations terminées.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9968:0:5"
msgid "Completed renovations towards <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."
msgstr "Обновление завершено: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>."

#. ja: 移転先が建築中のため、移転できません。
#. de: Das Gebäude kann nicht verlegt werden, da es sich im Bau befindet.
#. fr: Déplacement impossible, l'endroit sélectionné est en cours de con<shy>struc<shy>tion.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9969:0:5"
msgid "Unable to move building. The selected location is currently under construction."
msgstr "Не удалось переместить здание. На выбранном месте сейчас идёт строительство."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>の移転が完了しました。
#. de: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> wurde erfolgreich verlegt.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: déplacement terminé.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9970:0:5"
msgid "<sheet MJIText $n1 0> has been moved."
msgstr "<sheet MJIText $n1 0> перемещено."

#. ja: 外観を<sheet MJIText $n1 0>から<sheet MJIText $n2 0>に変更しました。
#. de: Du hast das Aussehen von „<sheet MJIText $n1 0>“ zu „<sheet MJIText $n2 0>“ geändert.
#. fr: L'apparence a été changée de <sheet MJIText $n1 0> à <sheet MJIText $n2 0>.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9971:0:5"
msgid "You changed the appearance of <sheet MJIText $n1 0> to <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."
msgstr "Вы изменили внешний вид: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> заменён на <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."

#. ja: <sheet MJIText $n1 0>から<sheet MJIText $n2 0>への建て替えが完了しました。
#. de: Das Gebäude wurde von <sheet MJIText $n1 0> zu <sheet MJIText $n2 0> umgebaut.
#. fr: <sheet MJIText $n1 0><nbsp>: recon<shy>struc<shy>tion en <sheet MJIText $n2 0> terminée.
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 91)>an<else>a</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 91 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet MJIText $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MJIText, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9972:0:5"
msgid "You reconstructed the <sheet MJIText $n1 0> into <if ($n2 == 91)>an<else>a</if> <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."
msgstr "Вы перестроили <sheet MJIText $n1 0> в <sheet MJIText $n2 0>."

#. ja: 素材が不足しているため、実行できません。
#. de: Nicht genügend Material.
#. fr: Impossible à effectuer, matériaux manquants.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9973:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute command. Insufficient materials."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить команду. Недостаточно материалов."

#. ja: 改築対象が存在しません。
#. de: Kein Umbau verfügbar.
#. fr: Aucun édifice rénovable.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9974:0:5"
msgid "You cannot perform renovations on this building at this time."
msgstr "Сейчас это здание нельзя обновить."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は<sheet BNpcName $n2 0>には効果がないようだ……。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> scheint keinerlei Effekt auf <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n2 1 4 1> zu haben<nbsp>...
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> n'a aucun effet sur <noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n2 1 1>.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9975:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> was ineffective against <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n2 1 1>... "
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> не действует на <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n2 1 1>..."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>は、警戒して逃げ出してしまった……。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> ist aufgeschreckt und hat sich davongemacht<nbsp>...
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> a pris peur et s'est enfui<if "<sheet BNpcName $n1 6>">e</if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9976:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> sensed your presence and scampered away."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> почуял ваше присутствие и бросился наутёк."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>の捕獲に失敗したが、まだ警戒はされていないようだ。
#. de: Du konntest <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 4 1> nicht einfangen, wurdest aber auch noch nicht bemerkt.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> n'a pas pu être capturé<if "<sheet BNpcName $n1 6>">e</if> mais l'animal n'a pas remarqué votre présence.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9977:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> evaded your trap despite remaining blissfully unaware of your presence."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> избежал ловушки, даже не заметив вашего присутствия."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>の捕獲に成功した！
#. de: Du hast <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 4 1> eingefangen!
#. fr: Vous avez réussi à capturer <noun-fr BNpcName 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9978:0:5"
msgid "You successfully captured <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "Вы поймали <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: ターゲットが射程外のため実行できません。
#. de: Dein Ziel ist außer Reichweite.
#. fr: La cible est hors de portée.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9979:0:5"
msgid "Target is not in range."
msgstr "Цель вне зоны досягаемости."

#. ja: 「<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><sheet BNpcName $n3 0></if>」が満腹になった。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1 1></if></capitalize> frisst sich satt.
#. fr: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> est repu<if "<sheet BNpcName $n3 6>">e</if>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9980:0:5"
msgid "<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> feels pleasantly stuffed."
msgstr "<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> наелся до отвала."

#. ja: 「<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><sheet BNpcName $n3 0></if>」がよろこんだ。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1 1></if></capitalize> freut sich über die Zuneigung.
#. fr: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> est jovial<if "<sheet BNpcName $n3 6>">e</if>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9982:0:5"
msgid "<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> licks your hand in sheer joy!"
msgstr "<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><capitalize><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></capitalize></if> радостно лижет вам руку!"

#. ja: 現在サーバーが混み合っているため、無人島に行くことができませんでした。<br>しばらく時間をおいてからお試しください。
#. de: Du konntest nicht zu deiner Insel fahren, weil die Server zur Zeit überlastet sind. Bitte versuch es später wieder.
#. fr: Suite à la forte affluence sur le serveur, il est impossible de se rendre sur la Félicité insulaire.<br>Veuillez réessayer ultérieurement.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9983:0:5"
msgid "Due to extreme server load, you were unable to travel to the island sanctuary. Please try again later."
msgstr "Из-за высокой нагрузки на сервер не удалось попасть на остров. Попробуйте ещё раз позже."

#. ja: <if $n1><string $s2>の無人島が見つかりませんでした。<else>選択した無人島が見つかりませんでした。</if>
#. de: <if $n1>Die Insel von <string $s2> konnte nicht gefunden werden.<else>Die Insel konnte nicht gefunden werden.</if>
#. fr: <if $n1>La Félicité insulaire de <string $s2> n'a pas pu être trouvée.<else>La Félicité insulaire sé<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>née n'existe pas.</if>
#. macro: <if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2>'s island could not be found.<else>Unable to enter. The selected island could not be found.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9984:0:5"
msgid "<if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2>'s island could not be found.<else>Unable to enter. The selected island could not be found.</if>"
msgstr "<if $n1>Не удалось войти. Остров игрока <string $s2> не найден.<else>Не удалось войти. Выбранный остров не найден.</if>"

#. ja: <if $n1><string $s2>の無人島は、人数制限のため入れません。<else>選択した無人島は、人数制限のため入れません。</if>
#. de: <if $n1>Die Insel von <string $s2> ist bereits voll.<else>Die Insel ist bereits voll.</if>
#. fr: <if $n1>Impossible de se rendre sur la Felicité insulaire de <string $s2> suite aux restrictions sur le serveur.<else>La Felicité insulaire selectionnée est inaccessible suite aux restrictions sur le serveur.</if>
#. macro: <if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2>'s island is currently full.<else>Unable to enter. The selected island is currently full.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9985:0:5"
msgid "<if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2>'s island is currently full.<else>Unable to enter. The selected island is currently full.</if>"
msgstr "<if $n1>Не удалось войти. На острове игрока <string $s2> нет свободных мест.<else>Не удалось войти. На выбранном острове нет свободных мест.</if>"

#. ja: <if $n1><string $s2>の無人島は、入場禁止設定のため島に入れません。<else>選択した無人島は、入場禁止設定のため島に入れません。</if>
#. de: <if $n1>Der Zugang zur Insel von <string $s2> ist dir nicht gestattet.<else>Der Zugang zu dieser Insel ist dir nicht gestattet.</if>
#. fr: <if $n1>La Félicité insulaire de <string $s2> n'est pas accessible aux visiteurs.<else>La Félicité insulaire sé<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>née n'est pas accessible aux visiteurs.</if>
#. macro: <if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2> has forbidden access to their island.<else>Unable to enter. The islekeep has forbidden access to their island.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9986:0:5"
msgid "<if $n1>Unable to enter. <string $s2> has forbidden access to their island.<else>Unable to enter. The islekeep has forbidden access to their island.</if>"
msgstr "<if $n1>Не удалось войти. <string $s2> запретил посещать свой остров.<else>Не удалось войти. Хранитель острова запретил посещения.</if>"

#. ja: 「<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><sheet BNpcName $n5 0></if>」のニックネームを「<if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><sheet BNpcName $n5 0></if>」に変更しました。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1 1></if></capitalize> hört jetzt auf den Spitznamen „<if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><noun-de BNpcName 5 $n5 1 1 1></if>“.
#. fr: Le surnom de <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n5 1 1></if> a été modifié en <if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n5 1 1></if>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 5, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s4> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9987:0:5"
msgid "Changed <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if>'s nickname to <if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if>."
msgstr "<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if> теперь откликается на кличку «<if ($n3 == 1)><string $s4><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n5 1 1></if>»."

#. ja: 「<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><sheet BNpcName $n3 0></if>」を逃がしました。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1 1></if></capitalize> wurde freigelassen.
#. fr: Vous avez relâché <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9988:0:5"
msgid "You released <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы отпустили <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if>."

#. ja: 「<if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><sheet BNpcName $n3 0></if>」の飼育委託を依頼しました。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-de BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1 1></if></capitalize> hat nun einen eigenen Fütterungsplan.
#. fr: Vous avez confié <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if> à un curateur.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9989:0:5"
msgid "You entrusted the creature comforter with the care of <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы поручили утешителю животных заботу о <if ($n1 == 1)><string $s2><else><noun-en BNpcName 2 $n3 1 1></if>."

#. ja: アイテムが指定されていないため、実行できません。
#. de: Es wurde noch kein Gegenstand ausgewählt.
#. fr: Action impossible<nbsp>: aucun objet sélectionné.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9990:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute action. You must select an item first."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить действие. Сначала выберите предмет."

#. ja: 指定されたアイテムが不足しているため、実行できません。
#. de: Du hast nicht genügend der ausgewählten Gegenstände.
#. fr: Action impossible<nbsp>: objets néccessaires insuffisants.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9991:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute action. Insufficient items."
msgstr "Невозможно выполнить действие. Недостаточно предметов."

#. ja: 探索日数、探索地を変更されていません。
#. de: Dauer und Ziel der Expedition wurden nicht geändert.
#. fr: Impossible de modifier le lieu ou la durée.
msgctxt "LogMessage:9992:0:5"
msgid "Unable to execute command. Neither the length nor the location of the expedition have been changed."
msgstr "Не удалось выполнить команду. Длительность и место экспедиции не изменились."

#. ja: 探索地を「<string $s1>」に変更しました。
#. de: Das Expeditionsziel wurde zu „<string $s1>“ geändert.
#. fr: <string $s1><nbsp>: lieu modifié.
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9993:0:5"
msgid "Changed expedition area to the <string $s1>."
msgstr "Место экспедиции изменено: <string $s1>."

#. ja: シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨<num $n1>枚を渡し、探索地を「<string $s2>」に変更しました。
#. de: Du hast <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauri<else>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris</if> ausgegeben, um die Expedition zu „<string $s2>“ zu ändern.
#. fr: <string $s2><nbsp>: lieu modifié et durée allongée contre <num $n1> assignats insulaires azur.
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9994:0:5"
msgid "You spent <kilo $n1 \",\"> seafarer's cowries to extend the duration of the expedition and change the area to the <string $s2>."
msgstr "Вы потратили <kilo $n1 \",\"> синих раковин мореплавателя, чтобы продлить экспедицию и изменить её место на «<string $s2>»."

#. ja: シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨<num $n1>枚を渡し、「<string $s2>」の探索日数を延長しました。
#. de: Du hast <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauri<else>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris</if> ausgegeben, um die Dauer der Expedition „<string $s2>“ zu verlängern.
#. fr: <string $s2><nbsp>: durée allongée contre <num $n1> assignats insulaires azur.
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:9995:0:5"
msgid "You spent <kilo $n1 \",\"> seafarer's cowries to extend the duration of the expedition to the <string $s2>."
msgstr "Вы потратили <kilo $n1 \",\"> синих раковин мореплавателя, чтобы продлить экспедицию в область «<string $s2>»."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n1 0><if ($n3 > 1)>×<num $n3></if>を手に入れたが、最大所持数に達したため<num $n2>個のみ手に入れた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> <if ($n2 > 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1><else><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></if> erhalten.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtenez<else>obtient</if> <if ($n3 == 1)><noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n3> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if>, mais ne <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>pouvez<else>peut</if> en garder <if ($n2 == 1)>qu'<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">une<else>un</if><else>que <num $n2></if> car la sacoche est pleine.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
